    "detailed_description": "Mark February 22 in the history books since my dog turned five today and I finished TNT.<br>IT'S TIME to Thunk on a Thursday Nite with the best rhythm game in 22 years! Follow Jim-Bob's day, which includes:<br><u>Six levels that all play differently! (Two coming soon in updates)<br>Uniquely animated cutscenes for each level, done in several different styles!<br>An entertaining story!</u><br>T.N.T. is pretty short, and will most likely only take around an hour to complete, which is why it's free. I doubt anybody would buy it if it costed money. But the whole TNTeam put a lot of effort into this game and we hope you enjoy it!",
